{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100777","id":2250153437,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GHp3d","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100777","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100777.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100777.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100777","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100777/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100777/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100777/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a4ad5284425e0b36d37a2d3e32d668b0c8c05f8b","number":100777,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Support Per-Axis Sampler Repeat Mode","user":{"login":"IsaacMarovitz","id":42140194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTQwMTk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42140194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz","html_url":"https://github.com/IsaacMarovitz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsaacMarovitz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/246, #44553, and #51625\r\n\r\nSupporting this feature requires quite a few fundamental changes to parts of the core.\r\n\r\n- Rather than building a fixed list of a small subset of possible sampler permutations in `material_storage`, samplers can now be created as needed by calling `material_storage->sampler_rd_get()`. They are stored in a `HashMap` with the `RD::SamplerState` as the key, ensuring that duplicate samplers are never made. This `HashMap` is never trimmed unless the whole list is delloc'd. It's, therefore, possible to build a huge number of sampler variants by requesting many different states, but I don't think this will be much of an issue in reality.\r\n- `samplers_inc.glsl` is removed, as this fixed subset of samplers no longer exists. This means that every shader is expected to bind the required samplers as needed.\r\n- `DefaultIdentifierActions.custom_samplers` has been renamed to just `samplers` and can be used to define a mapping to an existing sampler binding when needed\r\n- `DefaultIdentifierActions.default_filter` and `DefaultIdentifierActions.default_repeat` have been removed\r\n- GLTF & FBX document classes have been updated to use the correct sampler state, resolving an unsupported part of their respective specs.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n - [ ] Fix missing canvas samplers\r\n - [ ] Fix up missing changes in Fog, Sky, and GI\r\n - [ ] Convert shaders using `append_uniforms`\r\n - [ ] Finalise hashing method\r\n - [ ] Finalise shader changes\r\n - [ ] Fix up mobile renderer\r\n - [ ] Sort out anisotropy and LOD bias","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"